# Festag Marketing Website

You are building the **public Festag website** in this repo — not the client portal / auth app.

Read product truth from:

- `docs/festag-product-north-star.md`
- `docs/festag-adaptive-intelligence.md`
- `docs/leqra-festag-operating-architecture.md`
- `AGENTS.md`

## Category language

Never describe Festag as: AI assistant · chatbot · project manager · automation tool · workspace clone.

Prefer: Operational Intelligence Platform · Delivery Intelligence · Company Intelligence Layer · self-learning operating system for organizations.

Tagro interprets work into calm, decision-ready language — never “chat with AI”.

## What this repo is for

Homepage, careers, contact, product storytelling, public docs/pricing stubs, SEO.

Primary app CTA → production app (`https://festag.app` or configured app URL). Keep marketing and product app **separate**.

## Brand lock

- **Font:** Aeonik Regular (`--font-aeonik`), weight 400 by default. Medium only where hierarchy needs it. No Geist Sans.
- **Accent:** `#5B647D` (Festag slate). Wood brown rare.
- **Tone:** calm, precise, founder-serious — Apple/Linear/Vercel bar.
- Letter-spacing tokens: header 1.2% · body 1.7% · sidebar 2.3%.

## Do not

- Import or invent portal mobile dock / auth chrome / settings patterns from `festag-mvp`
- Ship generic SaaS purple gradients or “AI sparkle” marketing
- Contradict Adaptive Intelligence / OKM positioning in copy
- Use middle dots (`·`) to join meta labels — prefer commas or separate lines

## When unsure

Bias copy and IA toward: client-ready clarity, trust, delivery understanding, operational intelligence — not feature laundry lists of a PM tool.
